# Browser
# Bot2 pays 1 life for its Swamp; Bot1's two Plains are destroyed with that payment as one action (CR 101.4, 118.12a). Each
# Plains would go to the graveyard, so Bot1's Rest in Peace and Bot2's Leyline of the Void both want to exile it instead, and
# Bot1, who controls both lands, chooses which applies to each (CR 616.1). With two simultaneous events to choose for, the
# page first asks which event's choice Bot1 makes next (CR 101.4c); Bot1 takes the second Plains, then Rest in Peace for it,
# then Leyline of the Void for the other. Both Plains are exiled and none reaches a graveyard.
